    "title": "DAVE - Images from Trave for recognition or segmentation",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.11353447",
    "publication_date": "2024-05-27",
    "description": "<p>The dataset contains images from a measurement run on the River Trave, with selected objects blurred to ensure privacy. Each image is accompanied by a JSON file that provides the coordinates of the blurred bounding box and the object category.</p>\n<p>Image data was recorded using a Hik Vision DS-2CD2T47G2-LSU/SL camera.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>This publication is a result of the research of the Center of Excellence CoSA and funded by the Federal Ministry for Digital and Transport of the Federal Republic of Germany (Id 19F2225C, DAVE).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Project website: https://www.th-luebeck.de/cosa/projekt/dave/</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
